Goal:
Produce lightweight candidate domains from repository structure.

Input:
- repo-facts
- repo-understanding draft if available

Output must follow:
docs/semantic/schemas/domain-candidates.schema.md

Output purpose:
Candidate domains to be merged into repo-understanding and review-summary.

Rules:
- domains are lightweight capability groupings only
- do not produce a full domain map
- examples: ranking, feature pipeline, inference pipeline, data fetch
